# CubismSdkForNative is a git submodule (Live2D/CubismNativeSamples, pinned to
# tag 5-r.5-beta.3.1). Core binaries and downloaded glew/glfw live INSIDE the
# submodule working tree as untracked content (suppressed via
# .gitmodules `ignore = untracked`) — fetch them with:
#   git submodule update --init --recursive
#   cmake -P scripts/Bootstrap.cmake

